&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;About the Role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Field Marketing Manager, Partners will help drive the field marketing for Justworks&#39; partner ecosystem—working with brokers, accounting firms, technology partners, and channel organizations to drive pipeline and revenue. This is high-impact work where you&#39;ll design programs that work for both Justworks and our partners, then execute them alongside sales teams. Your field marketing expertise directly shapes how we grow through partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and execute partner programs&lt;/strong&gt; tied to pipeline goals. You&#39;ll run events, webinars, co-branded campaigns, and activations that drive demand across your partner channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with sales teams&lt;/strong&gt; across Brokers, Accounting Partnerships, Technology Alliances, and Channel Sales. You&#39;re aligned on strategy, pipeline targets, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable partner programs.&lt;/strong&gt; Create toolkits, messaging, and resources that partners can use to execute campaigns on their own, not just one-off activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run integrated campaigns&lt;/strong&gt; that connect partner activities to broader company demand gen. You orchestrate events, email, content, and digital—making sure it all works together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the budget and vendors.&lt;/strong&gt; You manage program spend and vendor relationships (including co-marketing funds) to maximize ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track what works.&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor partner-sourced and partner-influenced pipeline. Use data to optimize where you invest and which programs drive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the marketing expert in the room.&lt;/strong&gt; Advise internal teams and external partners on strategy, execution, and what&#39;s working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years in field marketing or B2B demand generation&lt;/strong&gt;, with meaningful experience working with partners or indirect sales channels (brokers, accountants, resellers, technology partners).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You know field marketing fundamentals.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve executed regional campaigns, aligned with sales on pipeline, managed events, and measured results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re a cross-functional partner.&lt;/strong&gt; You work effectively with sales, partnerships, and marketing teams. You manage multiple stakeholders and keep programs moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re data-driven.&lt;/strong&gt; You track pipeline contribution and ROI. You use data to make better decisions about where to invest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You thrive in ambiguity.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner marketing is evolving, and you&#39;re comfortable building strategy as you go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in HR tech, payroll, fintech, or SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background selling to or through SMB or mid-market segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce, Marketo, HubSpot, or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of ABM or regional field marketing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner-sourced pipeline grows consistently quarter over quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programs are efficient and repeatable—partners can execute them independently, not just with your support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales, partnerships, and marketing teams trust you as their go-to person for partner marketing strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built a partner program engine that scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Justworks, you&#39;ll join a collaborative team that values innovation, curiosity, and customer impact. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to shape how Justworks grows through partnerships and help build programs that directly influence business success. We offer a supportive culture, meaningful work, and the chance to make a tangible impact at a rapidly growing company.&lt;/p&gt;
